 "regressFull/en": "<div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-2 space-y-2\" data-testid=\"writeback-panel\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-600\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Actual result (line balancing)</span><span>Project: p · Version: v · Result: r</span><span>Fetched at 10/28/2026, 8:00:00 AM</span><button data-testid=\"writeback-refetch\" class=\"ml-auto px-2 py-0.5 border rounded\">Re-fetch</button></div><div data-testid=\"writeback-lb-dropped\" class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-800 space-y-0.5\"><div>Line balancing left out at least 2 rows (work item ids of the first few: 21, 22), so they cannot be matched to MOST steps, and any of the steps below with no result may be for this reason</div><div data-testid=\"writeback-lb-dropped-key-damaged\">1 of them had a damaged link back to MOST; check that row's link in line balancing</div><div data-testid=\"writeback-lb-dropped-unknown\">1 of them was left out for a reason MOST does not recognise (line balancing work item id: 22)</div></div><div data-testid=\"writeback-lb-degraded-unattached\" class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-800\">3 more data warnings from line balancing do not match any step in this worksheet</div><div data-testid=\"writeback-lb-warnings-truncated\" class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-800\">Line balancing reported more problems than are shown here; only the first 2 are listed</div><div data-testid=\"writeback-units-baseline-unavailable\" class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-800\">Unit counts were not checked: this worksheet still has things to fix, so the line-balancing work items can't be built (fix those first).</div><div class=\"space-y-1\" data-testid=\"writeback-placements\"><div data-testid=\"writeback-motion-A\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[11px] border-b border-slate-100 py-0.5\"><span class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 truncate\">Step 1 “step A”</span><span class=\"text-slate-700\">At every station (general step), done by 1 people</span><span 